        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[‘UltraMad’ protest – official statement issued]]></title>
            <link>https://www.warhammer-community.com/en-gb/videos/gewaspxo/ultramad-protest-official-statement-issued</link>
            <guid>gewaspxo</guid>
            <pubDate>Sun, 30 Nov 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Our partners at Calth News have provided an update on the demonstrations demanding ‘More Ultramarines, More Often’ outside Warhammer headquarters, Nottingham. Now in their third day, the protest shows no signs of abating. 

The Warhammer Studio has now responded with an official statement.

How long can this last? We’ll have more on Warhammer Community as the situation unfolds. 

Let your voice be heard by email at: UltramarineBlues@gwplc.com]]></description>
